w_{r,b}(s)&=-L_0(s)-L_1(s)/j-L_3(s)/n-L_5(s)/V,\\
E_2(r,b)&=1+T\left(\frac15-\frac3{4j}-\frac1{2n}+\frac1{20V}\right).
\end{aligned}
\tag{25.8}
$$

On $H=0$ in the strict source domain, $E_2\ne0$, and the external world is

